DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The kkvvmm library provides an interface for accessing kernel virtual memory
     images for both native kernel images (where the ABI of the kernel
     executable matches the host system) and non-native kernel images.  The
     kkvvmm__nnaattiivvee() function returns a non-zero value if the kvm descriptor _k_d
     is attached to a native kernel image; otherwise it returns zero.

